<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>404 - Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      background: #0a0e0d;
      color: #e8e8e8;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .code {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 90px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #e8a94c;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    h1 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    p {
      color: #9a9a9a;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }
    .path {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      background: #161b1a;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      color: #e8a94c;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    a.home-btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #e8a94c;
      color: #1a1a1a;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: opacity 0.2s;
    }
    a.home-btn:hover { opacity: 0.85; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div>
    <div class="code">404</div>
    <h1>Halaman Tidak Ditemukan</h1>
    <p>Halaman <span class="path"><%= url %></span> tidak tersedia atau sudah dipindahkan.</p>
    <a href="/" class="home-btn">Kembali ke Beranda</a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>